    "explanation": "Senator Feinstein comments on a CIA report about pre-9/11 errors and calls for oversight/accountability boards. The text does not claim she secured, delivered, authored advancing legislation, prevented a negative outcome, or caused an agency action benefiting constituents. It is oversight/commentary, not credit-claiming.",
